@page
@{ ViewData["Title"] = "Account help"; }
<div class="page-heading"><div class="eyebrow">ACCOUNT HELP</div><h1>Keep your account secure.</h1></div>
<section class="grid two">
    <article class="card"><h2>Sign-in and recovery</h2><p>Use the password-reset option on the secure sign-in page if you have forgotten your password. If you use a Microsoft or Google account, recover access through that provider.</p><p>Store your recovery codes somewhere safe. Never share a password, recovery code, invitation code, or authentication code with support.</p><a href="/auth/login">Open secure sign-in</a></article>
    <article class="card"><h2>Passkeys and MFA</h2><p>A passkey lets you sign in using your device's screen lock or security key. Multi-factor authentication adds another check before you manage an airline.</p><p>Use the button below to complete a fresh security check or enroll an available factor. Factor availability depends on this installation.</p><a href="/auth/step-up">Verify or enroll a security factor</a></article>
</section>
